  "notes": {
    "title": "Cached startup, combat readability and playtest privacy",
    "summary": "The start screen now offers Play when the current build is cached. This update also improves combat readability, simplifies peaceful encounters and updates voluntary playtest sharing.",
    "changes": [
      "Play appears when both game files are cached; the download prompt estimates only the files still needed.",
      "Added compact skill details, hold-to-inspect controls and clearer combat numbers on phones. Level-up effects now appear on the reward cards.",
      "Peaceful encounters use shorter approach and exit paths; active skills are disabled outside combat. Navigation skips detailed searches between disconnected areas.",
      "Fixed a crash when opening the result after a timed Champion Trial.",
      "Playtest sharing requires a fresh opt-in with 18+ confirmation. Withdrawing consent stops uploads and requests deletion of shared data, with retry when back online."
    ]
  }
}